{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03793","headline":"度石门山 · 杜审言","name":"度石门山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门千仞断，迸水落遥空。\n道束悬崖半，桥欹绝涧中。\n仰攀人屡息，直下骑才通。\n泥拥奔虵径，云埋伏兽丛。\n星躔牛斗北，地脉象牙东。\n开塞随行变，高深触望同。\n江声连骤雨，日气抱残虹。\n未改朱明律，先含白露风。\n坚贞深不惮，险澁谅难穷。\n有异登临赏，徒爲造化功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}